umb/scxq68.jpg"}], "slug": "michinoku-hitou-koimonogatari-kai", "storyline": "During his journeys he will meet different girls and to take pictures of them he will have to defeat them in the hanafuda games.\n\nHanafuda are playing cards of Japanese origin (karuta cards), used to play a number of games. The name literally translates as 'flower cards'.", "summary": "Michinoku Hitou Koi Monogatari Kai is the \"sequel\" or better said is an updated version to Michinoku Hitou Koi Monogatari that was a mix between a first person adventure game and a hanafuda game that tells the story of a young photographer that travels around the northeast part of Japan playing hanafuda games and taking pictures of the places that he visit. In this \"sequel\" the game features hints to help the player win in the hanafuda games.", "themes": [{"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/michinoku-hitou-koimonogatari-kai", "videos": [{"id": 154724, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "Sfk8vPxSmvg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sfk8vPxSmvg", "title": "\u307f\u3061\u306e\u304f\u79d8\u6e6f\u604b\u7269\u8a9e Kai \u30a8\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Sfk8vPxSmvg/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}